<title>USA: LG&amp;E to buy stakes in Argentine gas distributors.</title>
<headline>LG&amp;E to buy stakes in Argentine gas distributors.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>LG&amp;E Energy Corp said on Monday it would buy interests in two Argentine natural gas distribution companies for $140 million.</p>
<p>The company said it would acquire a controlling interest in Distribuidora de Gas del Centro and a minority interest in Distribuidora de Gas del Cuyana from Sideco Americana SA, an Argentine energy, engineering and construction company.</p>
<p>LG&amp;E will manage both companies, while Sideco will keep an equity interest in the both.</p>
